{%- comment -%}
  Shared Article Index drink types. This is the single source of truth for the
  drink rows in every Article Index section, so category mappings are not
  duplicated per section. Each definition is:

    Label::reviews blog handle::reviews category tags::article index drink tags

  The first two fields keep the existing Reviews behaviour: most drinks map to
  a dedicated review blog, while the grouped "everything-nice" drinks are
  narrowed by their review category tags. The fourth field is the drink-type
  tag set used to classify articles inside the flat sections (Interviews,
  Features, Deep Dives), which all read a single blog each. Search also uses
  the drink-type values from these sets to build its aggregate "Other Drinks"
  filter, while excluding producer and brand-specific values.
{%- endcomment -%}
